    <mxCell id="api" value="&lt;b&gt;API layer · FastAPI&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#5F6368&quot;&gt;/check · /precheck · /report · /stats · WebSocket /ws/live&lt;br&gt;rate limit · PII-free access log · serves the PWA&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#34A853;fontSize=13;fontColor=#202124;align=left;spacingLeft=12;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
